---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import me from '../assets/images/me.jpg'
import ButtonLink from '../components/ButtonLink.astro'
import Slider from '../components/Projects/Slider.astro'
---

<Layout title='Maxime Condaminat - Front-end Engineer'>
  <main>
    <section class='wrapper hero'>
      <h1>
        maxime
        <span>condaminat</span>
      </h1>
      <div>
        <p>
          Hi 👋, I’m Maxime, a front-end engineer based in France. I build products with
          TypeScript and React, and I’ve spent the last 3 years in web3.
        </p>
        <p>
          I am currently <strong>looking for my next role</strong>, ideally on a larger-scale product where I can grow
          toward tech lead.
          <a href='mailto:contact@maximecd.com'>Let's talk?</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class='wrapper'>selected work</h2>
      <Slider />
    </section>
    <div class='wrapper grid-section'>
      <section class='past-exp'>
        <h2>past experiences</h2>
        <ul class='past-exp__list'>
          <li>
            <span class='past-exp__date'>june 2024 - july 2026</span>
            <h3>Full-stack Developer</h3>
            <h4>nüme</h4>
            <p>
              Joined the early team of an art digitisation startup and built the software side from scratch: a
              platform where owners browse their artworks, with records stored on-chain through ERC-4337 smart
              accounts, a block explorer for our contracts, and a Tauri desktop app driving an art-scanning robot. I
              also set up the infrastructure, from Docker and CI/CD to Coolify deployments and Cloudflare.
            </p>
            <ul class='techs'>
              <li>React</li>
              <li>Laravel</li>
              <li>Tauri</li>
              <li>viem</li>
              <li>Docker</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class='past-exp__date'>sept. 2023 - now</span>
            <h3>Full-stack Developer</h3>
            <h4>Freelance</h4>
            <p>
              Built a full NFT marketplace for premium spirits from scratch and contributed to other NFT sales
              platforms, connecting the front end to smart contracts with wallet-based flows. Shipped features end to
              end on a Laravel SaaS used by several thousand users.
            </p>
            <ul class='techs'>
              <li>Next.js</li>
              <li>wagmi</li>
              <li>viem</li>
              <li>Laravel</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class='past-exp__date'>sept. 2022 - aug. 2023</span>
            <h3>Full-stack Developer (work-study)</h3>
            <h4>Nexi Conseils</h4>
            <p>
              Developed, maintained and shipped features on a 2000+ users SaaS. Built 6 fully customizable WordPress
              themes from scratch.
            </p>
            <ul class='techs'>
              <li>Laravel</li>
              <li>React</li>
              <li>WordPress</li>
              <li>Sass</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <ButtonLink href='https://www.linkedin.com/in/maximecondaminat/'>
          <svg
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
            width='24'
            height='24'
            viewBox='0 0 24 24'
            fill='none'
            stroke='currentColor'
            stroke-width='2'
            stroke-linecap='round'
            stroke-linejoin='round'
            class='lucide lucide-file-spreadsheet'
            ><path d='M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z'></path><polyline
              points='14 2 14 8 20 8'></polyline><path d='M8 13h2'></path><path d='M8 17h2'></path><path d='M14 13h2'
            ></path><path d='M14 17h2'></path></svg
          >
           view my full résumé
        </ButtonLink>
      </section>
      <section class='about'>
        <h2>about me</h2>
        <Image src={me} alt='Maxime Condaminat' />

        <p>
          Hello! I'm <strong>Maxime</strong>, a French front-end engineer with 4 years of experience, 3 of them in
          web3. I like owning features end to end, with a lot of autonomy.
        </p>

        <p>
          Day to day I work with <strong>React and TanStack</strong> (Start, Router, Query), Jotai or Zustand, Tailwind
          or StyleX, and Base UI. On the web3 side: viem, wagmi, passwordless wallet onboarding with embedded wallets
          and passkeys, and ERC-4337 smart accounts. I've also shipped desktop apps with Electron and Tauri.
        </p>

        <p>
          I graduated as a <strong>Full-stack Developer</strong> from La Rochelle Université, and I still work across
          the stack: Node.js and Bun with Hono and Effect, and a lot of Laravel. Knowing what the backend needs makes
          me a better front-end engineer.
        </p>

        <p>
          My most recents :
          <ul>
            <li>
              <a href='/work/satella'>Satella</a> : a local-first, encrypted portfolio tracker built with Effect and
              React
              <a href='https://github.com/maximecd/satella' target='_blank'><code>[source]</code></a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href='https://labs.maximecd.com/' target='_blank'>Labs</a> : NextJS + Framer motion animated modern
              components
              <a href='https://github.com/maximecd/labs' target='_blank'><code>[source]</code></a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href='https://slider-menu-effect.vercel.app/' target='_blank'>Menu slider animation</a> : An animated
              menu rebuild : React, PandaCSS and GSAP
              <a href='https://github.com/maximecd/slider-menu-effect' target='_blank'>
                <code>[source]</code>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class='contact wrapper'>
      <h2>contact</h2>
      <div class='grid'>
        <div>
          <p>Want to talk about a position ? A project ? I'm always open to proposals, so feel free to email me !</p>
          <ButtonLink href='mailto:contact@maximecd.com'>
            <svg
              xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
              width='24'
              height='24'
              viewBox='0 0 24 24'
              fill='none'
              stroke='currentColor'
              stroke-width='2'
              stroke-linecap='round'
              stroke-linejoin='round'
              class='lucide lucide-send'><path d='m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4Z'></path><path d='M22 2 11 13'></path></svg
            >
             get in touch
          </ButtonLink>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>You can also find me here :</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <svg
                xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
                width='24'
                height='24'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                fill='none'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                stroke-linecap='round'
                stroke-linejoin='round'
                class='lucide lucide-linkedin'
                ><path d='M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z'></path><rect
                  width='4'
                  height='12'
                  x='2'
                  y='9'></rect><circle cx='4' cy='4' r='2'></circle></svg
              >
              <a href='https://linkedin.com/in/maximecondaminat' target='_blank'>linkedin.com/in/maximecondaminat</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg
                xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
                width='24'
                height='24'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                fill='none'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                stroke-linecap='round'
                stroke-linejoin='round'
                class='lucide lucide-github'
                ><path
                  d='M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4'
                ></path><path d='M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2'></path></svg
              >
              <a href='https://github.com/maximecd' target='_blank'>github.com/maximecd</a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style lang='scss' ù>
  main {
    background-color: var(--clr-white);
    color: var(--clr-text);
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 6.4rem;
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      margin-bottom: 7.6rem;
    }
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--ff-headings);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1em;
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      font-size: 3.6rem;
    }
  }

  .hero {
    margin-top: 3.2rem;

    div {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6.4rem;
      margin-top: 6.4rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: var(--ff-headings);
      font-size: 3.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1em;
      line-height: normal;
      & > span {
        display: block;
        color: var(--clr-text-light);
      }

      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        font-size: 4.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }
    }

    p:not(:last-child) {
      margin-bottom: 1em;
    }
  }

  .grid-section {
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 34.5rem;
      gap: 6.4rem;
    }
  }

  .past-exp {
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      order: 1;
    }

    ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    h3 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      line-height: normal;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }
    h4 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: normal;
      margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
      color: var(--clr-text-light);
    }
    &__list {
      & > li {
        margin-bottom: 3.2rem;
      }
    }
    &__date {
      line-height: normal;
      color: var(--clr-text-lighter);
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    p {
      margin-bottom: 1em;
    }
    .techs {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.8rem;
      li {
        color: #a3590e;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        background-color: rgba(225, 122, 18, 0.12);
        border-radius: 99px;
        padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
      }
    }
  }

  .about {
    img {
      width: 50%;
      border-radius: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1em;
    }
    p:not(:last-child) {
      margin-bottom: 1em;
    }

    a:has(> code) {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: rgb(43, 33, 47);
    }
  }

  .contact {
    .grid {
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 34.5rem;
        gap: 6.4rem;
      }
    }

    p {
      margin-bottom: 1em;
    }
    :global(.button-link) {
      margin-bottom: 1em;
    }
    ul {
      padding: 0;
      color: var(--clr-link);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.8rem;
      li {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1.2rem;
        list-style-type: none;
        align-items: center;
        svg {
          width: 1.8rem;
          height: 1.8rem;
        }
      }
    }
  }
</style>
